BT /F1 11 Tf 72 576 Td (slightly lower pitch is easier to listen to for long stretches.) Tj ET
BT /F2 13 Tf 72 540 Td (Follow along) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 72 520 Td (When Follow the voice is switched on, the page scrolls itself to keep the current) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 72 504 Td (sentence in view. Switch it off if you want to flick ahead through the document while) Tj ET
